{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "8b1f6337-dad4-5a17-b0f5-7c236c9f47c5", "source_ordinal": 872, "reading_ordinal": 3185, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "抱怨游戏", "published_at": "2025-04-01T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/371d8912086111f083995254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "自然环境对“抱怨”这种行为根本没有反应。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "天不下雨，你难道能抱怨出一朵云来？", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 38}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "那么抱怨就是指着有人因为听着烦来帮忙解决问题了？", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 63}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "那么能解决问题的人马上就会想到一个最基本的矛盾——“如果抱怨就可以得到救济，那么我越救济，抱怨就会越严重。这样我实际是在鼓励抱怨。”", "char_start": 64, "char_end": 130}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "于是这些人只剩下以下几个选择：", "char_start": 131, "char_end": 146}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "1）无视抱怨。", "char_start": 147, "char_end": 154}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "随你怎么抱怨，我都不给你任何救济。任由你自己消耗能量，自己消停。", "char_start": 155, "char_end": 187}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "2）惩罚抱怨。", "char_start": 188, "char_end": 195}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "我不想听抱怨，因为抱怨对我有负面影响，所以我抓住几个抱怨声音最大的给予打击，这样耳根清净。", "char_start": 196, "char_end": 241}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "3）奖励不抱怨的。", "char_start": 242, "char_end": 251}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这个更直接——既然我想少听抱怨，那么我就去奖励不抱怨的好行为，让不抱怨的人得利。", "char_start": 252, "char_end": 292}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这还有一个升级版——即拿走抱怨得比较狠的那部分人的资源，用于奖励不太抱怨的那一群人。", "char_start": 293, "char_end": 335}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "羊毛出在羊身上，大幅节省处置成本。", "char_start": 336, "char_end": 353}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "不言而喻，最聪明的就是最后这个策略。", "char_start": 355, "char_end": 373}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "现在你退后一步，看看整部剧里的三个角色——被抱怨者、弱抱怨者、强抱怨者，在这幕剧里各自的得失。", "char_start": 374, "char_end": 421}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "被抱怨者只是搞搞乾坤大挪移，付出较少代价，甚至没有代价——ta的操作成本往往还会从被剥夺的强抱怨者身上找回来。", "char_start": 422, "char_end": 477}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "弱抱怨者得益，ta分到了被没收的强抱怨者的福利。", "char_start": 478, "char_end": 502}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "强抱怨者倒霉，ta不但被割去一块肉送给弱抱怨者，这手术费还要ta肉偿。", "char_start": 503, "char_end": 538}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "现在我们再在这基础上把模型进一步细化——如果强抱怨者自身身无分文，根本无肉可割怎么办？", "char_start": 540, "char_end": 583}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这里魔鬼的一段来了——那么这些身无分文的强抱怨者会被豁免——毕竟ta们无可惩罚。", "char_start": 584, "char_end": 624}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "所有的剥夺都要由有产阶层中的强抱怨者承担，只不过从ta们手里剥夺的资源也不会拿来奖励破产强抱怨者，因为这同样会产生奖励抱怨的效应。", "char_start": 625, "char_end": 690}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "最后的净结果会是什么呢？", "char_start": 691, "char_end": 703}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "是赤贫抱怨者实际上有免费的抱怨特权，ta们抱怨基本不会有后果。但ta们抱怨造成的损害，往往会由抱怨强度和ta们接近但却享受着某种利益的有产强抱怨者承担，而这部分利益会用来奖励弱抱怨/无抱怨者。", "char_start": 704, "char_end": 800}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "而同样是发放奖励，如何分配奖励带来的综合收益最大呢？", "char_start": 801, "char_end": 827}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "就是最优先奖励赤贫的无抱怨者——因为同样一千块，对大凉山少年当然比对上海中产的激励更大。", "char_start": 828, "char_end": 872}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "现在你可以看到整个问题的全图了吧？", "char_start": 873, "char_end": 890}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "在抱怨游戏中，", "char_start": 891, "char_end": 898}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "赤贫强抱怨者没有损失也没有奖励；", "char_start": 899, "char_end": 915}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "有产强抱怨者承担所有罚金；", "char_start": 916, "char_end": 929}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "赤贫无抱怨者优先获得奖励；", "char_start": 930, "char_end": 943}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "有产无抱怨者第二顺位获得奖励；", "char_start": 944, "char_end": 959}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "有产弱抱怨者第三顺位获得奖励。", "char_start": 960, "char_end": 975}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "而因为后三者都得到了奖励，后三者都会支持被抱怨者、对抗赤贫强抱怨者和有产强抱怨者实施这个游戏规则。而这时有产强抱怨者又会发现——由于赤贫强抱怨者并没有可损失的利益，并且和有产强抱怨者有天生的文化隔阂，ta们并不会是自己的坚强盟友。", "char_start": 976, "char_end": 1091}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "因此尽管自己是这个游戏的唯一打击对象，自己却无力对抗受益者联盟。", "char_start": 1092, "char_end": 1124}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "因此这个游戏规则获得了数学上充分的稳定性。", "char_start": 1125, "char_end": 1146}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "这就是抱怨游戏在自然法则下被隐形限定的运行法则。", "char_start": 1147, "char_end": 1171}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "如果被抱怨者不按照这个法则来主持游戏，那么所有的损失最终都会由ta来承担——这实际上是自然法在惩治拒绝遵从其命令的被抱怨者。", "char_start": 1172, "char_end": 1234}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "哪里是生门，哪里是死门，谁将在游戏中受益，谁将在游戏中受损，这里都算给你们看了。", "char_start": 1235, "char_end": 1275}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "看看你自己在哪里，想想你自己该站在哪里。", "char_start": 1276, "char_end": 1296}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "何为强者？", "char_start": 1297, "char_end": 1302}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "能做出正确的选择的人就是强者。", "char_start": 1303, "char_end": 1318}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 43}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0460"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：你们怎么评价「强者从不抱怨环境，只有弱者才会」这种思维和心态？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041"], "summary": "围绕“抱怨游戏”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“自然环境对“抱怨”这种行为根本没有反应。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "自然环境对“抱怨”这种行为根本没有反应。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "db41c345-b9c3-5901-b79f-6e9b322aec78", "source_ordinal": 871, "reading_ordinal": 3186, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "多子多福", "published_at": "2025-04-02T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/ba71303008d311f0bf5c52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "传统家庭伦理里的“让着弟弟一点”是有前提的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "前提就是长幼有序，大哥大姐地位默认在弟妹之上。", "char_start": 23, "char_end": 46}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "吃饭先动筷子，家产优先继承，家族资源优先分配。", "char_start": 47, "char_end": 70}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "三少爷还在捉知了，大少爷已经管米铺了。", "char_start": 71, "char_end": 90}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "弟弟年纪越小，在正式权利上、利益上就越被动、越可怜，所以要“让着一点”，而父母也往往出于歉意，会“宠着一点”。", "char_start": 91, "char_end": 146}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "而另一面，父母宠爱幼子又会注意分寸，因为这种宠爱有毒。这个毒还不是指把幼子宠坏导致骄纵，而是将来长子继承掌权后，过于得宠的幼子可能引发长子的猜忌、敌视，进而遭遇残酷的、斩草除根式的攻击。", "char_start": 147, "char_end": 240}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "因此，教导幼子尊重、服从长子，反而是为幼子保平安的明智之举。", "char_start": 241, "char_end": 271}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "现在不少家庭又开始恢复多子女家庭的格局，这些传统智慧其实自然而然的又要运转起来。", "char_start": 272, "char_end": 312}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这些伦理机制其实是跨越时代局限的，否则也不至于一代代传承成这个稳定状态。", "char_start": 313, "char_end": 349}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "有人会想“为什么不把家产平分呢？”", "char_start": 350, "char_end": 367}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这在数学上其实是天然错误的——分散的资本就是贬值的资本。分散成一万份的一亿现金微不足道，而所有权集中的一亿现金却足以获得超额利息。", "char_start": 368, "char_end": 433}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "光是这份孳息的差额，都足以养活一两千号人了。", "char_start": 434, "char_end": 456}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "拆分家产约等于寻求毁灭，是最愚蠢的家族经济安排之一，甚至连“共同持股”都是祸患之源，其最终结果往往是无数的哈姆雷特和兄弟阋墙。", "char_start": 457, "char_end": 520}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "唯一可行的只有长子继承后支持次子创业或者从文、从学、从仕、从艺。", "char_start": 521, "char_end": 553}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "“让着弟弟妹妹”是建立在这个承诺前提之上才存在的伦理要求。", "char_start": 554, "char_end": 583}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "如果你主张“兄弟姐妹一律平等”——再次警告，这注定是个错误——你就根本没有立场去要求“让着弟弟妹妹”。", "char_start": 584, "char_end": 635}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你甚至将没有立场阻止子女之间的互相排挤和仇恨——大哥把二弟杀了，身为父母能杀了仅剩的大哥为二弟复仇吗？", "char_start": 636, "char_end": 687}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "何止不会，甚至还会帮着造假掩护，以免失去仅剩的骨血。", "char_start": 688, "char_end": 714}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "既然如此，兄弟之间就会构成致命的囚徒困境，产生巨大的博弈压力。", "char_start": 715, "char_end": 746}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "父母不理解养育多子女的致命法则，自然法就会惩罚整个家庭的所有人。", "char_start": 747, "char_end": 779}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "道理已经讲给你听了，你自己想好怎么办吧。", "char_start": 780, "char_end": 800}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 21}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0460"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我和我大女儿因为小儿子闹的有点僵，这是谁的问题？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021"], "summary": "围绕“多子多福”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“传统家庭伦理里的“让着弟弟一点”是有前提的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "传统家庭伦理里的“让着弟弟一点”是有前提的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "df896b52-02c6-54a8-a942-b71bd50299e6", "source_ordinal": 870, "reading_ordinal": 3187, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "镜面不锈钢", "published_at": "2025-04-02T13:23:56.137000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1890446748742285164/answer/1890755718774236477"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "说句公道话，小米不太可能有什么法律责任。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "哪怕事后调查发现它的确存在设计缺陷，只要这个缺陷不属于法定强制要求的范围，都不会因此产生法律责任。", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 70}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "除非有证据发现它粗制滥造、使用与承诺不符的假冒伪劣零件，否则一切后果都要由明知且合意的消费者自行承担。这是成年人天然的生存责任，没什么好说的。", "char_start": 71, "char_end": 142}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "但这里面真正值得注意的是两点：", "char_start": 143, "char_end": 158}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "1）“公关能力”过强是有反噬性的。事发几天都没能看到当事人家庭的发声，这是一个影响极坏的现象。用户家里死了三个人都说不出话来，这已经是“一手遮天”级别的压制言论行为。", "char_start": 159, "char_end": 242}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "小米公关部门在干一件极蠢的蠢事——这恰恰是一个战术上无比勤奋，但在战略上极为愚蠢的行为。", "char_start": 243, "char_end": 287}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "因为固然让当事人家庭第一时间口不择言会严重伤害股价，但这种伤害可以借助公开、坦荡的承认问题、赔偿损失、诚实改进而酝酿成更坚固的品牌。用户看到你有错就认、有错就改，事后只会对你有更大的信任。", "char_start": 288, "char_end": 382}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "然而第一时间本能的去搞消声行为却会导致客户从此对你一切的正面信息都自动做打折看待，甚至干脆反向看待。", "char_start": 383, "char_end": 433}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "太平无事，多美好，但太平无事是把“有事”全捂住的结果，那么太平无事必然意味着“你现在在拼命捂”，而万一出了一两起，那更糟，意味着“你拼命捂都捂不住了”。", "char_start": 434, "char_end": 510}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "从此以后你只有“糟糕”和“糟糕到无法遮掩”这两种表现。", "char_start": 511, "char_end": 538}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "一件本来你就大概率无责的平常事故，被你万分勤奋的操作成企业再也难以洗脱的道德污点。", "char_start": 539, "char_end": 580}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这个才是处理这类问题的正确态度：", "char_start": 581, "char_end": 597}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这位维修师傅实际上用这个行为无意中创造了一项“信誉神话”，比起所谓“认错的屈辱”“赔偿的损失”，这项战略资产要远远的值钱得多。", "char_start": 599, "char_end": 662}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这是赚了，不是亏了。", "char_start": 663, "char_end": 673}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "堂堂万亿资产的企业，连这个基本法则都不能理解，不是越有钱越勇猛坚决，而是越有钱越懦弱回避，这是值得触及灵魂的自我拷问的。", "char_start": 674, "char_end": 734}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "为什么？", "char_start": 735, "char_end": 739}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "因为你在靠自己塑造的偶像崇拜赚你本不该赚到的钱，把大笔反复延期的以信用为抵押的借贷算到了利润科目下，只要信用这抵押物有丝毫贬值，你就要破产。", "char_start": 740, "char_end": 810}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "2）没有“公关能力”的企业反而有自然法自动授予的福利。", "char_start": 812, "char_end": 839}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "因为你没有这种全网噤声的神通，那么你如果名声不好总可以理解为“网民总有不理性的”，而名声如果能有毁誉参半，那就已经成为一项重要的正面资产。", "char_start": 840, "char_end": 909}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "因为“毁誉参半”里的“毁”未必严肃，但在铄金众口之中你居然还有一誉，这一誉自然是烈火真金。", "char_start": 910, "char_end": 955}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这当然不是指你可以任由人造谣没有后果，或者任由人侵犯你的商业机密、合法隐私或者践踏你的人格尊严。", "char_start": 956, "char_end": 1004}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "但是你要分清楚“保护合法利益”和“保护美誉”之间的区别。", "char_start": 1005, "char_end": 1033}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "不要花时间保护“美誉”。“美誉”并不是一项值得投入那么多资源去维护的资产。它不但是一种成本上的浪费，而且是一种资产上的负债。", "char_start": 1034, "char_end": 1096}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "要主动的把“毁誉参半”视为一件值得欣慰的“理想状态”，而不是一个“只好接受的遗憾”。就像军刀的表面不如直接做酸洗喷丸，而不要去做镜面不锈钢一样。", "char_start": 1097, "char_end": 1169}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2025-04/02/IMG_8705.jpeg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 26, "image": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0460"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：SU7 高速上车祸起火致 3 死，小米称事故前处于辅助驾驶状态，由车主介入退出，这种情况该如何定责？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024"], "summary": "围绕“镜面不锈钢”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“说句公道话，小米不太可能有什么法律责任。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "说句公道话，小米不太可能有什么法律责任。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "cc5536dc-1e7a-536c-b4f2-9c776b97c621", "source_ordinal": 869, "reading_ordinal": 3188, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "祸不及也", "published_at": "2025-04-02T22:35:30.814000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/641648705/answer/1890895025438693089"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这很好回答。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "比如张三受贿，家里存款一千万。现在事发了，要收缴非法所得，这一千万有三百万在张三儿子名下，要依法追缴。", "char_start": 7, "char_end": 58}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "失去这300万，算不算“祸”？", "char_start": 59, "char_end": 74}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "算吗？", "char_start": 75, "char_end": 78}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你们知道什么叫祸吗？", "char_start": 79, "char_end": 89}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "神不福者为祸——导致你失去上天祝福的东西就是“祸”。", "char_start": 90, "char_end": 116}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "失去这300万，你会重新获得上天的祝福，这是“福”。", "char_start": 117, "char_end": 143}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "得到这300万，你会失去上天的祝福，这才是“祸”。", "char_start": 144, "char_end": 169}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "看懂没有？", "char_start": 170, "char_end": 175}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "得到不义之财才是祸，沾惹必致不祥的是非，那已经是祸。", "char_start": 176, "char_end": 202}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "难道你走路捡到毒贩丢失的二十磅纯的，你要大喜？", "char_start": 203, "char_end": 226}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "有人现在来和你说——这东西交出来，我给你来个盖章的回执证明你已经上交了。", "char_start": 227, "char_end": 263}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你失去了这笔“富贵”，你是遭祸了吗？", "char_start": 264, "char_end": 282}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你是得福了吧？", "char_start": 283, "char_end": 290}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你现在看出问题来没有？", "char_start": 292, "char_end": 303}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "把得到这不义之财视为福，把失去它视为祸，这本身就是黑白颠倒的价值观造成的伪问题。", "char_start": 304, "char_end": 344}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "向贪污犯的家属追缴非法所得，乃至于将犯罪分子明正典刑，这本身是在帮助ta们摆脱无尽的罪孽纠缠，是在赐福。", "char_start": 345, "char_end": 397}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "真正的问题根本不是“是否应该祸及家人”，而是“为什么不要福及家人”。", "char_start": 398, "char_end": 432}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "为什么在解脱了主犯的罪孽之后，却要将ta的家人抛弃在罪孽的纠缠之中，弃之于不顾？", "char_start": 433, "char_end": 473}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "就因为那包ta捡到的毒品，ta自己吸得很high？ta吸的上瘾，ta觉得谁夺走ta的药就是ta的敌人，即意味着夺走ta的药不是在拯救ta而是在迫害ta了吗？", "char_start": 474, "char_end": 552}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "ta不是一条命吗？ta甚至还不是真正的罪犯，只是无辜的卷入了这场罪孽，为什么不要【救】ta？", "char_start": 553, "char_end": 599}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "人啊，一旦拜了财神，往往就完全丧失了基本的得失、是非判断能力。", "char_start": 600, "char_end": 631}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这就是一个经典的例子。", "char_start": 632, "char_end": 643}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "没有发现这个答案的，要自己反省一下。", "char_start": 644, "char_end": 662}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "不要一看到“得到利益”就咬定是福，不要一看“失去利益”就咬定是祸。", "char_start": 663, "char_end": 696}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "那是拜物教的信条，是“要钱不要命”的道德。", "char_start": 697, "char_end": 718}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 27}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0460"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何评价“祸不及家人的前提是惠不及家人”这个观点？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026"], "summary": "围绕“祸不及也”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这很好回答。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这很好回答。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "13249eb5-38e0-5980-949f-f7e697f75887", "source_ordinal": 868, "reading_ordinal": 3189, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "面向纪要会议", "published_at": "2025-04-03T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/bb0b845e0a6e11f0b49952540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "我介绍一种管理风格，你们自己将来主持工作时可以参考。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "那就是“面向纪要的会议”。", "char_start": 27, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "要树立一种观念——开会不是为了“商量事情”，而是为了“产生会议纪要并签字”。", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 79}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这种会议分为以下几条：", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 91}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "会前需要做的基本作业——例如需要分发的阅读资料、数据、议程安排等等。", "char_start": 92, "char_end": 126}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "最重要的是，这份作业里包含了“需要你在会上上交的输出物”。", "char_start": 127, "char_end": 156}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "每一个人都要在会前提前先阅读清楚这些资料，把自己的作业做好，同时要把自己该在会上交上来的输出物准备好。", "char_start": 157, "char_end": 208}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这是为会议的第一阶段——即信息采集、情况说明部分——做好准备。", "char_start": 209, "char_end": 240}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "关键来了——这个会前作业里的输出物有一个标准格式，即你要按照会前发放的会议说明主动准备好准备记入会议纪要的摘要以及你的作业本体。", "char_start": 241, "char_end": 305}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "摘要+本体，这两个部分都要齐备。", "char_start": 306, "char_end": 322}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "本体可以是文件包、压缩包，这个你现场需要演示时可以用。但是，你必须要同时准备好一段你自己认为已经可以充分表达你这些内容的要点的、提纲挈领的摘要。", "char_start": 323, "char_end": 395}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "我作为主席、领导，我坦白告诉你——我会像老鹰一样盯着你这份摘要的水平。", "char_start": 396, "char_end": 431}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "因为最终的会议记录其实是这样由各个参会者提交的摘要直接连缀而成，我极端的依赖一份高质量的会议纪要来从全局视角俯视整个问题的全貌。", "char_start": 432, "char_end": 496}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你的摘要如果失真，我是会勃然大怒的。", "char_start": 497, "char_end": 515}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "我听了你的报告、看了你的摘要，如果发现你的摘要没有充分的索引效能，我会当场提出修改、增删其中的词句，以保证我事后独处回顾会议记录时能以此为线索去调取详细资料。", "char_start": 516, "char_end": 595}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "公平起见，我会询问你对这个修订有何补充或者修订，以确保你也同意这个摘要仍然符合你要表达的要点。", "char_start": 596, "char_end": 643}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "但是你要清楚，我提出这样的修订，已经是某种意义上的警告。", "char_start": 644, "char_end": 672}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "再说一遍——我是围绕会议记录工作的。", "char_start": 673, "char_end": 691}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "我记不住你们那些长篇大论、五彩缤纷的东西，至少我不自信肯定可以记住。我的工作方法是在这种会议上主要确保你提交的资料和摘要对得上。", "char_start": 692, "char_end": 756}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你不要拿我当你爹妈，我要记住的数据和事务太多，我只能依赖高度凝练的摘要来管理。你来个丢三落四、张冠李戴，自己都把自己的摘要写漏写错，你在我这一定不会有什么很好的职业前途。", "char_start": 757, "char_end": 842}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "尤其是，这份纪要不是只对我有用，而是对参会的所有人都有用，ta们要依赖这份资料往下开会，这是法定依据。", "char_start": 843, "char_end": 894}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "我对那种建立在“各人凭记忆回顾刚才听到了些什么”的进一步讨论没有兴趣，因为这种个人记忆根本就不可靠。", "char_start": 895, "char_end": 945}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "每个人都要严格的按照刚刚生成的第一阶段会议纪要及其相关附件大全为基础去推进第二阶段会议。", "char_start": 946, "char_end": 990}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这意味着会议开完第一段，所有人就都要拿着整个精炼、完整的第一阶段会议纪要，从更高的视角俯视会议采集的所有信息，然后再在这个资料基础上准备好在方案、结论阶段自己要提交的会议纪要片段。", "char_start": 991, "char_end": 1081}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "我会给时间让各位写好，这些片段先交上来，秘书先把会议纪要草案做好了，然后才召开第二段会议。", "char_start": 1082, "char_end": 1127}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "第二阶段是意见、建议阶段。", "char_start": 1128, "char_end": 1141}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "第二段会议的基本形式，就是各位站起来解释一下属于自己的那段会议纪要具体是什么意思。", "char_start": 1142, "char_end": 1183}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "你写出来的就是一百多个字，说明了你的意见和建议。现在给你几分钟，把这一百多个字背后的想法、逻辑讲清楚。现场录音、录像。", "char_start": 1184, "char_end": 1243}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "你讲着讲着觉得这个摘要有些地方要修改，可以，允许，你让会议秘书帮你改改。", "char_start": 1244, "char_end": 1280}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "但你讲完坐下了，属于你的那段纪要就固定了。", "char_start": 1281, "char_end": 1302}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "全部讲完，第二段纪要——即意见与建议部分，也就自然完成了。", "char_start": 1303, "char_end": 1332}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "然后秘书把前两段的会议记录发给所有人。", "char_start": 1333, "char_end": 1352}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "一般而言，按我的风格，我的决策会直接做出，当时做，我当时就会告知会议秘书在纪要上如何写。", "char_start": 1353, "char_end": 1397}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "这包括了下一步的所有推进安排、奖惩决策。", "char_start": 1398, "char_end": 1418}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "写完了，所有人对整个会议纪要没有进一步的修改需求了，散会。会议纪要及相关附件抄送所有相关人并永久存档。", "char_start": 1419, "char_end": 1470}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "此后的一切纷争、业绩核查、工作落实，都以这份记录为准。", "char_start": 1471, "char_end": 1498}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "这种会议，大屏幕上的主要内容不会是PPT——那最多是某人讲解时切到自己的画面临时的搞一下——而是一个文字简洁的纵向大纲结构。", "char_start": 1500, "char_end": 1562}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "它没有多少现场打字或者由会议秘书来“发挥主观能动性和语言艺术代为总结”的做法，而是本段会议之前各责任人先写好的，秘书还没进入下一段会议就依次收集、拷贝、粘贴做好了。", "char_start": 1563, "char_end": 1645}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "会开完，会议记录就自动完成，而且本身会议就是围绕会议纪要展开的，没人会在最后还来掰扯折腾。", "char_start": 1646, "char_end": 1691}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "会一开完，就有白纸黑字的共识摆在那，该怎么做，自然就落实了。", "char_start": 1692, "char_end": 1722}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "如果你能做到这一步，你就会看到这个严谨的、记录充分的过程会自然地威慑住任何想要打马虎眼、消极怠慢的人。", "char_start": 1723, "char_end": 1774}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "因为没有给你留下余地。", "char_start": 1775, "char_end": 1786}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "同时，反过来，谁要是适应不了这样的工作风格，例如自称“没什么文化，没能力的写摘要”，那么至少你是没资格参与这样的会议的。", "char_start": 1787, "char_end": 1847}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "这样的人只会偶尔被邀请列席，提供一些现场资料什么的，不可能给你什么管理责任。", "char_start": 1848, "char_end": 1886}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "能写摘要、养成提交摘要的习惯，这是基本要求。达不到建议你不要指望管理岗。", "char_start": 1887, "char_end": 1923}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "另外，绝不能容忍开了半天会，七嘴八舌扯了半天，会议纪要没有写下一个字这种情况。", "char_start": 1924, "char_end": 1963}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "没有提交纪要——包括没把问题思考成熟到能写出纪要的程度——你根本没资格、没必要占用这么多人的时间。", "char_start": 1964, "char_end": 2013}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "纪要应该是在你开口之前自己提交上来的，不是你说完了秘书再去犯愁“我怎么替ta总结”的事。", "char_start": 2014, "char_end": 2058}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "在我这绝不允许“秘书掌管共同叙事”这种事。", "char_start": 2059, "char_end": 2080}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "你们想想吧。", "char_start": 2081, "char_end": 2087}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 51}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0460"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何写好公司会议中的会议纪要？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050"], "summary": "围绕“面向纪要会议”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“我介绍一种管理风格，你们自己将来主持工作时可以参考。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "我介绍一种管理风格，你们自己将来主持工作时可以参考。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "4ba821af-4dd8-560c-ae2b-251391990a2c", "source_ordinal": 867, "reading_ordinal": 3190, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "老态纵横", "published_at": "2025-04-04T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/49afbf840b3911f080df52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这是个很好的问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "其实现代人拥有了一个很大的自由，但很多人没有意识到。", "char_start": 10, "char_end": 36}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "那就是在化妆技术、整容技术、现代医学、保健学等等科学成就的帮助下，现代人有很强的外貌选择权。", "char_start": 37, "char_end": 83}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "以前你头发白了就是白了，现在染发分分钟。", "char_start": 84, "char_end": 104}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "以前你皮肤松弛了就是松弛了——这和接触阳光、紫外线有很大关系——现在，一来白领工作大幅增加，二来护肤、保湿、抗皱、祛斑、祛纹的各种技术实在发达。", "char_start": 105, "char_end": 177}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "以前你的肌肉、骨骼老化了就是老化了，现在各种健身、医疗矫正可以消除你必须扭腰、塌肩才能缓解的酸痛劳损，让你重新站直，", "char_start": 178, "char_end": 236}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "以前你有慢性病基本就那样了，整天只能坐着、躺着，或者步履蹒跚，现在对常见慢性病已经有了大量的手段大大的延缓病程。", "char_start": 237, "char_end": 293}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "以前你老了，就自有一套“养生哲学”教你“粗茶淡饭”让你自觉把蛋白质份额让给年轻人。现在蛋白质供应毫无困难，别说顿顿鱼肉，就算顿顿吃虾都可以随你。", "char_start": 294, "char_end": 366}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "就是性功能，现在都有随处可得的药物资源帮你保持活跃。", "char_start": 367, "char_end": 393}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "换言之，现代人，只要经济条件允许——并且这个经济条件要求还越来越低——想要不老，就可以不老。", "char_start": 394, "char_end": 440}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "现在，老是一种选择，而不是一种遭遇。", "char_start": 441, "char_end": 459}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "真正的问题，是国内流行着一种对老态的向往。", "char_start": 460, "char_end": 481}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这听起来似乎很诡异，但你如果仔细观察，会发现中国的文化有相当强的“崇老”属性。它使得认老、显老成了一种在心理上有利可图的无意识行为。", "char_start": 482, "char_end": 548}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "1）老人免于苛刻审视。", "char_start": 549, "char_end": 560}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "中国文化有强烈的“尊老爱幼”传统。“爱幼”也罢了，说白了是一种宠爱。但“尊老”是实实在在、恭恭敬敬的。", "char_start": 561, "char_end": 612}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "没有人会说老人丑陋。没人会嫌弃老人土气。没有人会嫌老人反应迟钝、悟性低下。", "char_start": 613, "char_end": 650}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这样做天然的受社会反感。", "char_start": 651, "char_end": 663}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "2）老人的话有额外的分量，老人的待遇有额外的加成。", "char_start": 665, "char_end": 690}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "老人基本上默认被视为半个道德楷模、半个智者、半个领导。一个老人，只要平平安安、普普通通，仅仅凭着ta历经风雨、平安到老这一条，ta就已经是某种意义上的成功者，已经拥有了值得重视的话语权。", "char_start": 691, "char_end": 784}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "我们和老人说话，天然的默认用敬语。", "char_start": 785, "char_end": 802}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "但你去看香港社会，就会发现香港的风气是没有这种崇老、敬老风气的。最受尊敬的是59岁以下年富力强的中年人，甚至四十、三十岁以下“当打之年”的青壮年，如果是女性则年龄更要下移。", "char_start": 804, "char_end": 890}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "香港社会基本上把老人视为“应该自觉退出社会隐居”的“福利依赖者”，既不是社会的智者，也不是社会的压舱石。不但没有多少优待、崇敬，甚至略有歧视和排斥。", "char_start": 891, "char_end": 965}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "所以在大陆，人们普遍并不特别抗拒呈现老态，往往稍微步入中年，就放弃了形象管理，任由老态呈现，甚至有时会故意表演老态——例如自称老李、老张。", "char_start": 966, "char_end": 1035}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这就是香港人往往比大陆人同龄不太显老的底层原因。", "char_start": 1036, "char_end": 1060}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "现在的问题是——我们的社会是在渐渐向香港方向漂移，还是在向传统崇老社会回归？", "char_start": 1062, "char_end": 1100}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "这才是你自己选择时要考虑的关键要素。", "char_start": 1101, "char_end": 1119}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 29}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0460"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么香港艺人不显老？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026"], "summary": "围绕“老态纵横”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这是个很好的问题。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这是个很好的问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "042a0cc5-6099-5fdf-b803-b27994862983", "source_ordinal": 866, "reading_ordinal": 3191, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "炭与柴", "published_at": "2025-04-04T09:03:53.279000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/14945738429/answer/1891415538447675625"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "1000斤木头可以做多少木炭呢？大约350斤。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "意思是有650斤水。", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 34}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "在古代，在木炭产区要获得能把这650斤水去除的燃料显而易见是非常便宜的——这里都盛产木炭了，柴火当然便宜了。", "char_start": 35, "char_end": 89}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "假设张三弄了一头驴，背了350斤木炭去集市。", "char_start": 90, "char_end": 112}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "李四弄了三头驴，驮了1000斤木柴去集市。", "char_start": 113, "char_end": 134}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "到地方张三租了个摊位，李四却租了个铺面——一千斤木柴还有三头驴可不是巴掌大的地面可以装下的。", "char_start": 135, "char_end": 181}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "结果李四发现张三卖了500文钱，自己却只卖了400文——因为顾客还得多雇两头驴把1000斤木柴运回家啊，这钱不得扣除吗？", "char_start": 182, "char_end": 242}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "回家算算，少赚100文，还得再扣掉两头驴的租金，扣掉额外的摊位租金。", "char_start": 243, "char_end": 277}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "张三要扣掉啥？只要多扣掉一点本身不要钱的烧炭用的木柴。", "char_start": 278, "char_end": 305}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "算完了，李四下次还卖木柴不？", "char_start": 306, "char_end": 320}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "当然，张三对李四的优势是随距离递增的。如果交易地点离砍柴地点足够近，也会出现李四比张三有优势的现象。毕竟古代人口密度低，出城就是树林的情况也不少。", "char_start": 322, "char_end": 395}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "无论如何，贩运距离长了，一定是炭比柴划算。", "char_start": 396, "char_end": 417}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0460"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：木头明明可以直接当柴烧，为什么古人要把木头加工成木炭售卖呢？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012"], "summary": "围绕“炭与柴”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“1000斤木头可以做多少木炭呢？大约350斤。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "1000斤木头可以做多少木炭呢？大约350斤。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "5dab5408-8d30-52f1-9669-69a4b566c0e5", "source_ordinal": 865, "reading_ordinal": 3192, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "侯嬴", "published_at": "2025-04-05T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/d553e1340c0911f09acb52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这是社会舆论年轻化导致的一个副作用。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "年轻人掌握了“舆论评价”这一公器，在执行着“分发荣耀”这样的社交职能，这就导致了一个很悲剧的错位——", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 69}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "年轻人容易按外在成就而不是按内在品格评价一个人的成功。", "char_start": 70, "char_end": 97}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "一来，这是ta们从学校按考分评优的评价体系里不假思索接受来的“天经地义”。", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 135}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "二来，ta们还不理解，其实成就有极大的运气成分，无能之辈也一样可能侥幸取得看似很庞大的成就。", "char_start": 136, "char_end": 182}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "真正可贵的是人的品格。是哪怕还毫无值得炫耀的成就，但威武不能屈、贫贱不能移、富贵不能淫，谦虚谨慎、戒骄戒躁、不卑不亢、不贪不傲的钢铁一样强健的人格。", "char_start": 183, "char_end": 257}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "是侯嬴、豫让这样处于下寮却如精钢的硬汉。", "char_start": 258, "char_end": 278}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "是红拂、秋瑾这样的决绝之人。", "char_start": 279, "char_end": 293}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "要论名利成就，这些人谈不上“赢家”，有些甚至算是“失败者”。", "char_start": 294, "char_end": 324}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "刺杀了别人一辈子，最后只能请被刺杀对象脱件衣服来全个念想，还不够失败吗？", "char_start": 325, "char_end": 361}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "但这些人却在传统文化中成为人间绝响，千古之下，读之仍然叫人意难平，心怀激荡。", "char_start": 362, "char_end": 400}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这是久历人世，知道什么是真正的艰难、什么是真正的可贵的中年人、老年人的价值观。", "char_start": 401, "char_end": 440}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "类似这样的人，没能功成名就，那是运气不好，而不是ta们人做得不好。", "char_start": 441, "char_end": 474}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "不必有这些成就，在还没赴赵之前，一介小吏侯嬴，年已七十，就能凭揖让气度让信陵君下拜。", "char_start": 475, "char_end": 517}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "人的成功不是靠那些成就、名利来认证的。", "char_start": 518, "char_end": 537}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "可惜，互联网时代，年轻人的舆论能量太大，无形中把至少舆论场上的评价标准归化成了年轻人的标准。", "char_start": 538, "char_end": 584}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "而年轻人是很难明白侯嬴、豫让这样身无分文、毫无才艺的“输家”有什么值得大礼参拜的。", "char_start": 585, "char_end": 626}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这也就导致了急于获得这种舆论认可的年轻人沾染了这种急功近利、过度重视外在成就的心态。", "char_start": 627, "char_end": 669}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0460"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么许多才二十岁出头的年轻人就着急迫切想成为所谓的人生赢家？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“侯嬴”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这是社会舆论年轻化导致的一个副作用。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这是社会舆论年轻化导致的一个副作用。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
